WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
Everything for your account lives on the Settings page.

2
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.760
Press Billing and it opens right there, with no new page.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.540
You can see your plan, the phone numbers this month and your next bill.

4
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:17.640
Every payment collected appears under past invoices, and this is

5
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.640
also emailed to you.

6
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.440
You can download a copy as a PDF for any invoice or of your

7
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:25.480
subscription confirmation.

8
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:29.800
Cancelling takes just two clicks, so it can never happen by accident.

9
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.220
If you cancel, your Checks keep running until the end of the paid period.

10
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.900
To sign in, enter your email and password, or ask for a sign-in link.

11
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.720
The link lasts one day.

12
00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:45.100
If you need it, you can ask for a six-digit code instead.

13
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.960
A code works for 15 minutes, then it stops working.

14
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:52.700
In Settings, you can set a password of at least 10 characters.

15
00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:57.500
Each contact can have an email, a phone number, or both.

16
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.520
Just enter an email and Quickler will invite them to your account.

17
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:06.220
Everyone who joins via email joins as an admin, so choose carefully.

18
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:10.980
If you add a phone number, that's how you can do Checks on WhatsApp and Telegram.

19
00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.320
With only a phone number, they never need to log in.

20
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:19.400
With only an email, they never need to do a Check on their phone.

21
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.720
If a new number takes you above your plan, Quickler will ask you to

22
00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.440
confirm the extra cost first.
